    "Id": "mechdef_centaur_battle_armor_CNT-STD_Sqd5",
    "Name": "Centaur Battle Armor",
    "Details": "Designed in secrecy, the Centaur is a Heavy-weight battle armor, first designed for the Republic of the Sphere's armed forces during the later Dark Age era. This was part of an effort by the Republic to develop a highly mobile battle armor-scale artillery piece. It was first built on Devil's Rock at the highly secretive Rhodes Foundry Ltd. factory, along with other secret projects. The battle armor first entered production in 3136 along with the Simian battle armor, and they would often be teamed up in the years ahead.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Experimental Design</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.895</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#2aad3b>Can mount any unit, can melee, can not swarm.</b></color>",
    "Icon": "BA_Phalanx"
  },
